<h3><%= primary_name %> invited you to join their household membership</h3>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p><strong><%= primary_name %></strong> has a household membership at Manchester Makerspace and invited you to join it. Joining is <strong>free</strong>: your membership is covered by theirs and follows the same dates.</p>
<p><a href="<%= invite_url %>">Accept the invitation</a></p>
<p>This link is for <strong>this email address only</strong> and works until <strong><%= expires_on %></strong>. If you do not have a portal account yet, you will create one first. You do not pay anything.</p>
<h4>Before you start</h4>
<ul>
  <li>The address on your account must match the household's address (same street number, street name and postal code), or you will not be able to join.</li>
  <li>You must come to the makerspace in person to get your key fob, and bring a photo ID that shows your name and address. A fob cannot be issued to you unless you are there.</li>
</ul>
<p>If you were not expecting this invitation, you can ignore this email.</p>
<p>Manchester Makerspace</p>
